R8	Addressee Arg1:T12 Arg2:T10	
T14	Entity 25081 25088	Harriet
T15	Cue 25104 25112	to speak
T16	Quotation 25113 25259	of the share he had had in their moonlight walks and merry evening games; and dwelt a good deal upon his being so very good-humoured and obliging.
T17	Entity 24981 24984	she
R9	Speaker Arg1:T14 Arg2:T16	
R10	Cueing Arg1:T15 Arg2:T16	
