R437	Addressee Arg1:T320 Arg2:T323	
R438	Speaker Arg1:T321 Arg2:T323	
T324	Quotation 81476 81483	"Come,"
T325	Cue 81484 81488	said
T326	Entity 81489 81491	he
T327	Quotation 81493 81652	"you are anxious for a compliment, so I will tell you that you have improved her.  You have cured her of her school-girl's giggle; she really does you credit."
R439	Cueing Arg1:T325 Arg2:T324	
R440	Cueing Arg1:T325 Arg2:T327	
R441	Speaker Arg1:T326 Arg2:T324	
R442	Speaker Arg1:T326 Arg2:T327	
R443	Addressee Arg1:T321 Arg2:T324	
R444	Addressee Arg1:T321 Arg2:T327	
