T342	Cue 82799 82806	replied
T343	Quotation 82808 83057	"that Harriet Smith will soon have an offer of marriage, and from a most unexceptionable quarter:-- Robert Martin is the man.  Her visit to Abbey-Mill, this summer, seems to have done his business.  He is desperately in love and means to marry her."
R465	Speaker Arg1:T341 Arg2:T340	
R466	Speaker Arg1:T341 Arg2:T343	
